 "strings": [
  "",
  "With the end of the One Year War,",
  "Jaburo",
  "acquired an entirely",
  "different strategic value.",
  "Jaburo, by rights",
  "a mere regional base",
  "in the Amazon basin,",
  "came to be mistaken for the",
  "Earth Federation's headquarters.",
  "Like an emperor's",
  "imperial seal in the old era,",
  "holding Jaburo",
  "came to be spoken of",
  "as if it conferred",
  "a government's legitimacy.",
  "That was a mistake politically",
  "and strategically alike,",
  "but most of those",
  "with the intelligence",
  "to point it out",
  "had died in the One Year War.",
  "Had Revil still been alive,",
  "he would have laughed to see",
  "the giant decoy he had set up,",
  "the dummy that was Jaburo,",
  "take on real substance.",
  "Jamitov, who might be called",
  "Revil's faithful heir,",
  "turned the situation to his use",
  "and declared Jaburo",
  "the Titans' headquarters.",
  "Actual production was dispersed",
  "to Gryps, Konpei Island, New Guinea,",
  "Kilimanjaro and elsewhere,",
  "with only the command center",
  "placed at Jaburo, in a form",
  "that could be moved at any time.",
  "Fully aware of that,",
  "the AEUG",
  "descended on Jaburo.",
  "If they secured the General Staff",
  "and Jamitov,",
  "the Titans could at one stroke",
  "be made illegal.",
  "The odds were hopeless anyway;",
  "without this operation, no political",
  "victory could be won, they judged.",
