  "\"Gather the prisoners in one place",
  " and start questioning officers!\"",
  "\"The rest of us head to Area 1",
  " in support!\"",
  "Roberto",
  "\"Strange, isn't it?",
  " The buildings in Area 1",
  " are nearly all empty.\"",
  "\"So they are...\"",
  "\"Could it be the Titans",
  " have cleared out",
