  "What drove Reccoa Londe was",
  "rage at Zeon for killing her family,",
  "and anger at the Titans, who killed",
  "the people of space without mercy.",
  "It was that passion, too,",
  "that drove her to decide",
  "to infiltrate Jaburo alone.",
  "But now she was a prisoner",
  "in a cell, together with a dubious",
  "journalist, a former White Base",
  "crewman, or so he claimed:",
  "Kai Shiden.",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"The AEUG's attack",
  " has begun.\"",
  "Kai",
  "\"How can you tell?",
  " Could be a mutiny, y'know.\"",
  "\"The timing fits!\"",
  "\"If only I'd made contact,",
